  "description": "SHAKA.DWE is an infrastructure-agnostic core library for defining and orchestrating distributed, event-driven workflows. It provides the foundational models and interfaces for workflow definitions, step execution, resilience (retries, circuit breaker, compensation), messaging, persistence, and registries, enabling workflows that publish events, await response events, and resume with retries/compensation via pluggable implementations.",
